# Satellite sinks (experimental): where the NYGC bwa-mem alignments of the 1000 Genomes 30x cohort (GRCh38 full analysis set
# plus decoys and HLA) place the reads of the ten satellite families of satellites.CHM13v2.k31.panel.tsv.gz. Learned from scans,
# not from the reference: ngsdose.sinks.learn(classes=[the ten families], min_frac=1e-5, min_reads=25, pad=1000) (claude/review-fixes 76e6fad)
# over 100 whole-file scans (engine fae1124, one panel set), 25 per release batch (2504, 698) and inferred sex, 15 populations
# (ACB, BEB, CDX, CHS, CLM, ESN, FIN, GBR, GWD, IBS, KHV, MSL, PEL, PJL, PUR). Specific to this aligner and reference: another pipeline learns its own (`ngsdose sinks`).
# Held-out capture, 1,648 other scans of the cohort (strict: a placement bin counts only if all of it lies inside; fully unmapped
# reads count as missed): min / median
#   HSat1A      30 intervals   0.22 Mb   0.9998 / 0.9999
#   HSat1B    1232 intervals  14.72 Mb   0.9659 / 0.9902; with the unmapped bin (count --unmapped) 0.9792 / 0.9942
#   HSat2       53 intervals   1.92 Mb   0.9999 / 1.0000
#   HSat3       92 intervals   3.56 Mb   0.9991 / 0.9997
#   aSatHOR    248 intervals  59.76 Mb   0.9985 / 0.9989
#   bSat       408 intervals   2.41 Mb   0.9993 / 0.9996
#   ACRO        22 intervals   0.43 Mb   0.9992 / 0.9996
#   SST1        34 intervals   0.61 Mb   0.9990 / 0.9997
#   CER         49 intervals   1.16 Mb   0.9995 / 0.9998
#   SATR        21 intervals   0.35 Mb   0.9983 / 0.9993
# Per-interval shares and the capture curve: sinks.satellites.stats.tsv. Training scans: HG00097 HG00113 HG00133 HG00285 HG00311 HG00375 HG00459 HG00474 HG00500 HG00513 HG00578 HG00582 HG00610 HG00642 HG00699 HG00743 HG01087 HG01111 HG01161 HG01169 HG01199 HG01256 HG01261 HG01272 HG01279 HG01358 HG01361 HG01438 HG01518 HG01520 HG01550 HG01567 HG01586 HG01622 HG01633 HG01674 HG01762 HG01797 HG01808 HG01841 HG01927 HG01937 HG01940 HG01956 HG01959 HG02018 HG02040 HG02074 HG02075 HG02090 HG02095 HG02129 HG02145 HG02223 HG02236 HG02261 HG02272 HG02280 HG02316 HG02321 HG02323 HG02351 HG02385 HG02523 HG02554 HG02585 HG02601 HG02656 HG02699 HG02704 HG02761 HG02772 HG02788 HG02816 HG02853 HG02862 HG02883 HG02968 HG02973 HG02978 HG03008 HG03009 HG03012 HG03017 HG03029 HG03040 HG03065 HG03079 HG03108 HG03119 HG03131 HG03135 HG03197 HG03224 HG03239 HG03306 HG03373 HG03453 HG03454 HG03480
